cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata, and cite the NISAR data separately (see DATA_SOURCES.md)."
title: "TriageSAR: from NISAR surface motion to an evidence-ranked infrastructure inspection queue"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-15
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
  - name: "TriageSAR contributors"
keywords:
  - NISAR
  - InSAR
  - GUNW
  - surface deformation
  - infrastructure inspection
  - NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026
abstract: >-
  TriageSAR converts NASA-ISRO NISAR Level-2 geocoded unwrapped interferograms into line-of-sight
  range change, classifies every pixel as valid, caution or excluded, extracts contiguous deformation
  zones, intersects them with OpenStreetMap roads and produces a transparent, deterministic inspection
  priority ranking with full provenance. It is a research prototype and not a damage assessment.
